<title>UK: BayerLB sets 10 billion peseta five-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerLB sets 10 billion peseta five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Santander Negocios, Merrill Lynch and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON     5.2	 MATURITY    04.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.024   PAY DATE    04.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	MATADOR BOND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
